- Machine learning-based file hygiene pattern recognition
- Predictive cleanup recommendations based on codebase evolution
- Integration with CI/CD pipelines for continuous hygiene monitoring
- Advanced reporting and analytics for file management trends

### **Task Database & Triage System** 📋 HIGH PRIORITY
